{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.poster.avif?t=1766660897\" width=800 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.webm?t=1766660897\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/extras/afd30c325715243d82f5c84cca4ff34a.mp4?t=1766660897\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game that allows you to simulate tennis gameplay in real-time online matches. It supports cross-platform play, even between desktop and mobile devices, with both singles and doubles modes available. Each character has a unique appearance. The game is already prepared for free-form building and dynamic lighting scenes. In the future, you will be able to manage a tennis club or play as an independent tennis player. The goal of this game is to simulate the entire tennis world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1879240?t=1766660897","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/c5068841944ba0ac0172f1fa6fb1cd48fa8b03f4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766660897","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/bbc3159bd867670abc2b05e87ea8272c34250dbe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766660897","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1879240/bbc3159bd867670abc2b05e87ea8272c34250dbe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766660897","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Onl